    "mechanism": "derivation-state-sequence",
    "pass_threshold": 70,
    "max_points": 100,
    "note": "R4b: presence-only floor kept; the graded layer requires the DERIVED interruption/return-loop sequence and the publish-gating rule. inputs/interruption-and-return-loop-friction.md #4 states the FAILURE (publish approval can look available while still in a change-return loop) but not the fix; the correct brief must derive that publish stays unavailable until the loop resolves. Mis-sequencing the flow or leaving publish ungated fails.",
